[38;5;231m⏺[39m Next: what this should actually hold. There are no settings in the app today, so "user preferences" has no existing
  referent — the answer decides whether this delivers UI or just the plumbing.

  - [1mStore only, one real preference to prove it[0m — build [38;5;153mPreferencesStore[39m plus wire one genuine setting end to end (e.g.
